    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boat, Snake &amp; Salvage is a snake-like arcade game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into uncharted waters to salvage treasures and amass fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit more crewmates, form strategic formations, and venture into vaster, more perilous waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.Salvage &amp; Growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your fleet to seek treasures in the waters! You can salvage treasures below your fleet's Strength. Each salvage boosts your fleet's Strength, enabling better hauls. But beware: collisions or overloading beyond Strength ends the game! Plan your fleet's route to maximize salvaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748440/extras/9019c8ef2d8cb056f9c8f6ee0cbd05f9.avif?t=1749219063\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Crew &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, recruit new crew members at the settlement store! Each member brings unique skills to enhance your fleet. Experiment with synergies to build your ultimate fleet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748440/extras/b9e55df19d8104b3610fa1a99c283dba.avif?t=1749219063\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boat, Snake &amp; Salvage is a snake-like arcade game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into uncharted waters to salvage treasures and amass fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit more crewmates, form strategic formations, and venture into vaster, more perilous waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.Salvage &amp; Growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your fleet to seek treasures in the waters! You can salvage treasures below your fleet's Strength. Each salvage boosts your fleet's Strength, enabling better hauls. But beware: collisions or overloading beyond Strength ends the game! Plan your fleet's route to maximize salvaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748440/extras/9019c8ef2d8cb056f9c8f6ee0cbd05f9.avif?t=1749219063\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Crew &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, recruit new crew members at the settlement store! Each member brings unique skills to enhance your fleet. Experiment with synergies to build your ultimate fleet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748440/extras/b9e55df19d8104b3610fa1a99c283dba.avif?t=1749219063\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p></li></ul>",
